l,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3861288930,"text":"It's not that different from the Light Actuating Ceremony.","nextNodeIds":[722250305]},{"nodeId":722250305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1248157034,"text":"Going to three spots to fix three smaller problems to solve a larger issue...","nextNodeIds":[722250306]},{"nodeId":722250306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2670215234,"text":"It feels like we've had this happen to us a lot, huh?","nextNodeIds":[722250307]},{"nodeId":722250307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":4256252170,"text":"I don't really understand a lot of what you said, but the adults do have this saying...","nextNodeIds":[722250308]},{"nodeId":722250308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":321714482,"text":"They call it \"The Rule of Three.\"","nextNodeIds":[722250309]},{"nodeId":722250309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":444891730,"text":"What's that supposed to mean?","nextNodeIds":[722250310]},{"nodeId":722250310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":2315047562,"text":"Well, I guess they just mean that you need to do things thrice in order to get a result.","nextNodeIds":[722250311]},{"nodeId":722250311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":2641393466,"text":"For example, they say that \"good omens must occur three times for good fortune to truly descend\"... Same for bad omens.","nextNodeIds":[722250312]},{"nodeId":722250312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":3640114522,"text":"They also say that \"you must forge past obstacles three times to succeed on the fourth.\"","nextNodeIds":[722250313]},{"nodeId":722250313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2648828698,"text":"But isn't that more like the \"Rule of Four,\" then?","nextNodeIds":[722250314]},{"nodeId":722250314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":572095474,"text":"Huh, that's true! You're really good at numbers, Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[722250315]},{"nodeId":722250315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2775756602,"text":"Hehe, of course!","nextNodeIds":[722250316,722250318]},{"nodeId":722250316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1528500290,"text":"How is that the point?","nextNodeIds":[722250317]},{"nodeId":722250317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2296643434,"text":"Anyway, are you sure Ku will be fine?","nextNodeIds":[722250319]},{"nodeId":722250319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":3762191234,"text":"Don't worry, he's always like this.","nextNodeIds":[722250320]},{"nodeId":722250320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"Ku","textMapHash":678537994,"text":"Ugh, what an embarrassment... I just hope this won't affect the ceremony.","nextNodeIds":[722250321]},{"nodeId":722250321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"Ku","textMapHash":1151799010,"text":"I wouldn't know how to face you if it does, Ruu.","nextNodeIds":[722250322]},{"nodeId":722250322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":1946217050,"text":"Oh, don't be like that! You've always been so nice to me!","nextNodeIds":[722250323]},{"nodeId":722250323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20449,"speakerName":"Ku","textMapHash":3285910130,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[722250324]},{"nodeId":722250324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":3923413202,"text":"#{NICKNAME}, Paimon, you two go ahead first!","nextNodeIds":[722250325]},{"nodeId":722250325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20320,"speakerName":"Ruu","textMapHash":1106302930,"text":"I'll stay here with Big Brother Ku. We'll take charge of the cleanup work once you're done with the offering!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722250318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3462778034,"text":"How's Ku's injury, by the way?","nextNodeIds":[722250319]}]},{"talkId":7222506,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7222505","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO